{{h1}}kotlinx.html

kotlinx.html is a code-first HTML DSL, not a text-template language.

- Follow the project's DSL, component, and attribute conventions.
- Keep domain logic outside markup construction and preserve safe text insertion.
- Validate generated markup and browser behaviour.

{{h2}}Reference
- [Kotlin HTML DSL](https://kotlinlang.org/docs/typesafe-html-dsl.html)
